# How big is Jupiter?
subtitle: "The planets drawn at their true sizes: how many Earths fit inside Jupiter, and why it weighs far less than its size suggests."
tags: ["astronomy","planets","solar system","size comparison","jupiter","density"]
teaches: ["concepts/planetary-scale","concepts/volume-calculation","concepts/density","vocabulary/gas-giants"]
voices: {"a":"gemini:Enceladus | an awed astronomer; slightly breathy wonder, but keep moving","take":"lines"}

## How big is Jupiter?
use: solar_system
with: {"view":"row","scale":"sizes","date":"2026-09-06"}

